The CCA outpost is protected on all sides by a natural terrain barrier, and the entrance to the outpost is heavily guarded by CCA units and gun towers. You may need to find a way over this barrier to sneak into the base unnoticed.

MISSION OBJECTIVES
- Rendezvous with our forces.
- Destroy the Soviet Radar Array.

ENGINEERING REPORT
You have been issued a Wolverine rocket tank outfitted with both Shadower and Thermal Hornet missiles. To launch missiles, you must hold down the fire button until the missile has acquired a lock. Once a lock is established, release the fire button to launch the missile at the target.